# Allium CI merge gate (FR-0.2)

- Pushes to `main`/`master` and pull requests run workflow `allium-specs`, which executes [`scripts/check-allium-specs.sh`](../../scripts/check-allium-specs.sh) (`allium check spec/`).
- After editing files under `spec/`, run `./scripts/check-allium-specs.sh` locally when the Allium CLI is installed, so CI does not fail on structural diagnostics.
- Changing the workflow should keep [`tests/ci_contract.sh`](../../tests/ci_contract.sh) in sync with the merge-gate wiring (the workflow runs that script first).
